{"id":"vod_sn_37716","vodId":"37716","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"碧蓝航线","name_cn":"碧蓝航线","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a4056fcf9de6add82f0064c1fd432ea6.jpg"},"summary":"曾经，来自海洋的神秘敌人“塞壬”向人类发起了猛烈的进攻，“碧蓝航线”的少女们凭借着她们钢铁般的意志与敌人奋勇作战，最终击败了对手，守护了人类。然而，随着时间的流逝，碧蓝航线内部因为理念的差异逐渐产生分化，衍生出了名为“赤色中轴”大的对立阵营。　　被称为“灰色的幽灵”的最强英雄企业（石川由依 配音）、每天都迷迷糊糊但关键时刻意外的顶用的拉菲（长绳麻理亚 配音）、虽然年纪不大但成熟体贴的大黄蜂（山本希望 配音），个性好强但心地善良的哈曼（伊藤明日香 配音），面对动荡的时局，当这些少女们再一次被推上战场，会发生怎样的故事呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:54:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/3a2HwufV8r1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/JLiYB4WHrQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y451NVCyHr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/E8yjMmgUdn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/bxaCjrUZfr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/92Ms2B4ZkL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VHA07vhCff1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/427YXUutwM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/zReSAFZKQg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/jkx7ppV7sK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CcGYkraMi11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/WbHXQpdzvy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/GyXgtXNMvd1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:07.264Z"}